   "id": 510907,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Calculate 716<sub>12</sub> − 4AB<sub>12</sub>.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "227<sub>12</sub>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A represents the digit 10.</p>\n<p>B represents the digit 11.</p>\n<p>Step 1: Do the one’s place first.</p>\n<p>You need to borrow from the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: (12 + 6) – 11 = 18 – 11 = 7</p>\n<p>In base 12: 7</p>\n<p>One’s place: 7</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\cancel{{1}}\"></span><br>0</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>You need to borrow from the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: (12 + 0) – 10 = 12 – 10 = 2</p>\n<p>In base 12: 2</p>\n<p>This column: 2</p> \n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\cancel{{7}}\"></span><br>6</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\cancel{{1}}\"></span><br>0</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 6 – 4 = 2</p>\n<p>In base 12: 2</p>\n<p>This column: 2</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\cancel{{7}}\"></span><br>6</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\cancel{{1}}\"></span><br>0</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"{227_{12}}\"></span></p>"
    }
